$$ A well-formed JCAMP header block that declares no data table at all.
$$ nmrglue reads it without error and returns data=None, which is the case
$$ UnparsableJcampData exists for. MS.dx used to serve this purpose; it parses
$$ on ComPlat/nmrglue@b0802a0, so a file that is unambiguously empty replaced
$$ it rather than another file that merely happens to fail today.
##TITLE=headers only, no data table
##JCAMP-DX=5.00
##DATA TYPE=INFRARED SPECTRUM
##XUNITS=1/CM
##YUNITS=TRANSMITTANCE
##FIRSTX=400
##LASTX=4000
##NPOINTS=0
##END=
